{
  "schema": "orca.head_envelope.v1",
  "id": "calibration-probe",
  "name": "Calibration probe (nozzle only)",
  "provenance": "Built in for the non-planar clearance calibration plate (docs/nonplanar/CALIBRATION.md): a 0.3 mm land and 35-degree nozzle cone to 4 mm, all inside the tip allowance, and a gantry far above, so the slicer neither clips nor bands the plate's steps while its paths still keep clear of the nozzle. Not a real head; never select it for a print.",
